WEBVTT

NOTE showcase: written VO text from episode.json, timed from the timeline VO placements

vo-b1-hook-1
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:16.952
A quick overview. In IntelliDash, Spatial
Adjust turns the latest moisture scan into

vo-b1-hook-2
00:00:17.052 --> 00:00:22.570
a percent adjustment, station by station.
The guides and episodes go step by step.

vo-b2-measure-1
00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:30.237
Each station's average VWC comes
from a TurfRad moisture scan,

vo-b2-measure-2
00:00:30.337 --> 00:00:32.490
dated beside the station name.

vo-b3-see-1
00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:42.286
The map colors stations by measured
moisture. Move the bands, or switch to

vo-b3-see-2
00:00:42.386 --> 00:00:46.840
variance to see each station against
its target. Map and table stay in sync.

vo-b4-target-1
00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:55.337
You set the target: the moisture
you want each station to hold.

vo-b4-target-2
00:00:55.437 --> 00:00:57.000
Every station gets its own.

vo-b5-calculate-1
00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:05.493
The gap between target and
measured, today's ET and your

vo-b5-calculate-2
00:01:05.593 --> 00:01:09.620
calculation settings together
become a suggested percent adjust.

vo-b5-threshold-1
00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.092
Below a minimum threshold,

vo-b5-threshold-2
00:01:13.192 --> 00:01:16.570
a suggestion is zeroed or lifted
to the threshold when you push.

vo-b6-review-1
00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:25.438
Before you push, override any suggestion,
replace or shift targets in bulk,

vo-b6-review-2
00:01:25.538 --> 00:01:30.350
find the outliers at both ends, or take
a station or hole out of adjustment.

vo-b7-push-1
00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:38.605
Nothing changes until you
push. Review the two lists,

vo-b7-push-2
00:01:38.705 --> 00:01:41.476
untick anything you're
unsure of, and send.

vo-b7-push-3
00:01:41.576 --> 00:01:46.540
Spatial Adjust writes each station,
then reads Lynx back and checks each one.

vo-b7-lynx-1
00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:50.832
Lynx itself must be set up
to match Spatial Adjust;

vo-b7-lynx-2
00:01:50.932 --> 00:01:52.860
the push guide lists the settings.

vo-b8-close-1
00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:57.240
Target minus measured, station by
station. That is the whole idea.
